msgid ""
"Port ``mtx`` / ``rv`` / ``ulinalg`` / ``umatrix`` / ``vec`` usage to "
":mod:`ulab` (:ref:`the math-library removal <v3_7_0_mathlibs>`)."
msgstr ""
"Porte a utilização de ``mtx`` / ``rv`` / ``ulinalg`` / ``umatrix`` / ``vec``"
" para :mod:`ulab` (\\ :ref:`a remoção das bibliotecas de matemática "
"<v3_7_0_mathlibs>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.7.0.rst:184
msgid ""
"Remove ``image.remove_shadows()`` / ``chrominvar()`` / ``illuminvar()`` "
"calls (:ref:`the removed image methods <v3_7_0_imgmethods>`)."
msgstr ""
"Remova as chamadas a ``image.remove_shadows()`` / ``chrominvar()`` / "
"``illuminvar()`` (\\ :ref:`os métodos de imagem removidos "
"<v3_7_0_imgmethods>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.7.0.rst:186
msgid ""
"Update ``image.draw_image()`` calls to the new keyword signature (:ref:`the "
"draw_image rework <v3_7_0_drawimage>`)."
msgstr ""
"Actualize as chamadas a ``image.draw_image()`` para a nova assinatura por "
"palavra-chave (\\ :ref:`a reformulação do draw_image <v3_7_0_drawimage>`\\ "
")."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.7.0.rst:188
msgid ""
"Review LCD scripts against the new ``lcd`` ``type`` / ``framesize`` API "
"(:ref:`the LCD rewrite <v3_7_0_lcd>`)."
msgstr ""
"Reveja os scripts LCD face à nova API ``type`` / ``framesize`` do ``lcd`` "
"(\\ :ref:`a reescrita do LCD <v3_7_0_lcd>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.7.0.rst:190
msgid ""
"Drop the −128 bias when passing Y to ``yuv_to_*`` (:ref:`the yuv_to_* change"
" <v3_7_0_yuv>`)."
msgstr ""
"Retire o viés de −128 ao passar Y para ``yuv_to_*`` (\\ :ref:`a alteração do"
" yuv_to_* <v3_7_0_yuv>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.7.0.rst:193
msgid "All other scripts run unchanged."
msgstr "Todos os outros scripts funcionam sem modificações."
